From a7735d704705d3ff15a1508be17afe7e422a68d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:00:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Sound step 1: DSi speaker path (power chip amp/mute bits +
 SNDEXTCNT I2S) when the sound engine powers on, dsplay (scale test / WAV
 player on /dev/dsp, Start menu 'Sound test'); volume: ARM7 reads the DSi
 volume level over I2C (bounded), applies it as codec DAC volume, sends it in
 a FIFO_BUTTONS message, /proc/dsivolume, desktop popup with percent

